"1. 创建或打开项目" = "1. Create or open a project";
"在启动页选择尺寸预设，或填写自定义画布参数后创建项目。已有作品可从启动页的项目区域打开，也可使用顶栏 … → 打开。创建或打开后，当前启动页标签会变为项目标签。" = "On the start page, choose a size preset or enter custom canvas settings to create a project. Open an existing work from the Projects area or the top bar’s … → Open. Creating or opening a project replaces the current start-page tab with a project tab.";
"顶栏中间的标签用于切换项目；拖动可排序，双击名称可重命名，右键可查看项目操作。启动页的项目与文件夹可拖动整理，双击文件夹进入。" = "Use the tabs in the center of the top bar to switch projects. Drag to reorder, double-click a name to rename, or right-click for project actions. Drag projects and folders on the start page to organize them; double-click a folder to open it.";
"2. 找到工具与编辑面板" = "2. Find tools and editing panels";
"底栏中央显示当前工具。点击工具名称展开工具菜单，再选择分类与具体工具；常用参数直接显示在底栏，笔头、颜色等按钮可打开相应设置。" = "The current tool appears in the center of the bottom bar. Click its name to open the tool menu, then choose a category and tool. Common parameters appear directly in the bottom bar; buttons such as Brush Tip and Color open their settings.";
"底栏左侧的图层按钮管理内容，右侧的效果器按钮添加效果。顶栏右侧的调节器按钮打开所选图层的参数面板。顶栏 … 提供添加图像、保存、吸附和网格等项目操作，以及本使用指南。" = "The Layers button on the left of the bottom bar manages content; the Effects button on the right adds effects. The Inspector button at the top right opens parameters for the selected layer. The top bar’s … menu contains project actions such as Add Image, Save, Snapping and Grid, as well as this guide.";
"3. 选择内容并管理图层" = "3. Select content and manage layers";
"先选择要编辑的图层，再使用工具或添加效果。移动工具可在画布上点选内容，按住 Shift 点击可多选；图层列表中按住 Command 点击可多选，Shift 点击可选择连续范围。" = "Select the layer you want to edit before using a tool or adding an effect. With the Move tool, click content on the canvas to select it; Shift-click to select multiple items. In the layer list, Command-click selects multiple layers and Shift-click selects a continuous range.";
"拖动图层可调整顺序，也可拖入文件夹；右键菜单提供重命名、蒙版和转换为普通图层等操作。多选后可编组或合并。眼睛按钮控制图层显示，锁定可避免误改。" = "Drag layers to reorder them or move them into a folder. Right-click for actions such as Rename, Mask and Convert to Regular Layer. Select multiple layers to group or merge them. The eye button controls visibility; locking a layer prevents accidental edits.";
"4. 绘制、修复与编辑内容" = "4. Paint, repair and edit content";
"画布分类提供移动、裁剪、抓手、缩放和取色工具；绘制与修饰工具用于处理当前图层。需要限制操作范围时，先用选区工具建立选区；Command + D 可取消选区。" = "The Canvas category contains Move, Crop, Hand, Zoom and Eyedropper tools. Painting and retouching tools work on the current layer. To limit edits to an area, make a selection first; Command + D deselects it.";
"智能修复位于修饰分类。选中可编辑的图像图层后，调整笔刷大小并涂过要移除的瑕疵；涂抹时会显示覆盖范围，松开鼠标后在本机完成修复。建议分次处理小区域，不满意可用 Command + Z 撤销。" = "Smart Repair is in the Retouch category. Select an editable image layer, adjust the brush size, then paint over the blemish to remove. A coverage preview appears while painting, and repair runs locally when you release the mouse. Work on small areas in separate strokes; use Command + Z to undo an unwanted result.";
"文字工具点击画布可建立文字，双击已有文字可直接修改，Command + 回车完成编辑。钢笔工具建立路径，闭合后仍是路径；通过路径右键菜单可转为选区、画笔描边或用于路径修饰。" = "Click the canvas with the Text tool to create text, or double-click existing text to edit it directly. Command + Return finishes text editing. The Pen tool creates paths that remain paths when closed. Use a path’s right-click menu to make a selection, stroke it with a brush or use it for path retouching.";
"5. 调整图层与效果" = "5. Adjust layers and effects";
"在效果器面板选择分类并添加效果，再到调节器调整参数。未选中图层时添加效果，会自动建立 FX 调整图层。文字、渐变等特殊图层的专用调节器位于切换器首位；基础调节器用于位置、尺寸等通用属性。" = "Choose a category in the Effects panel and add an effect, then adjust it in the Inspector. Adding an effect with no layer selected creates an FX adjustment layer. Special layers such as text and gradients have a dedicated inspector first in the switcher; the Basic inspector handles shared properties such as position and size.";
"数值可左右拖动调整，也可点击输入；双击滑块把手恢复该参数的默认值。需要对比效果时，可切换效果的启用状态。自由变换使用 Command + T，回车应用，Esc 取消。" = "Drag a number left or right to adjust it, or click to type a value. Double-click a slider handle to restore that parameter’s default. Toggle an effect on or off to compare the result. Use Command + T for Free Transform, Return to apply and Esc to cancel.";
"6. 使用标尺与专业图谱" = "6. Use rulers and scopes";
"顶栏 专业 → 进入标尺模式后，底栏切换为绘图辅助工具。选择工具后在画布上绘制辅助线；选中后右键可锁定，Delete 可删除。右键画布外的标尺可切换单位。此模式下撤销只影响标尺操作，点击完成保留修改，点击取消放弃本次修改。" = "Choose Pro → Enter Ruler Mode in the top bar to replace the bottom bar with drawing aids. Choose a tool and draw guides on the canvas. Right-click a selected guide to lock it, or press Delete to remove it. Right-click an outer canvas ruler to change units. Undo in this mode affects only ruler edits. Done keeps your changes; Cancel discards changes made in this session.";
"专业 → 显示图谱可检查亮度与颜色分布。图谱面板可拖动摆放，靠近窗口边缘时可吸附，便于一边编辑一边观察。" = "Choose Pro → Show Scopes to inspect brightness and color distribution. Drag the scopes panel to reposition it; it can snap near window edges so you can monitor the image while editing.";
"7. 保存项目与导出图片" = "7. Save projects and export images";
"继续编辑时，请用 Command + S 保存为 .imgp 项目；另存为使用 Shift + Command + S。保存项目会保留图层和编辑信息。需要交付图片时，点击顶栏导出，选择格式与选项后导出；导出图片不能代替项目保存。" = "To continue editing later, use Command + S to save an .imgp project, or Shift + Command + S for Save As. Project files retain layers and editing data. To deliver an image, click Export in the top bar, choose a format and options, then export. Exporting an image does not replace saving the project.";
"PSD 可用于交换像素图层；文字、智能对象及复杂图层效果的兼容性有限。需要完整保留本应用的编辑结构时，始终另存一份 .imgp。" = "PSD can exchange pixel layers, but compatibility for text, smart objects and complex layer effects is limited. Always keep an .imgp copy to preserve the app’s complete editing structure.";

